    "detailed_description": "This game is made on Unreal Engine 5.<br />\r\nYou need to use the toy rifle to shoot the balls to destroy objects.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn the game, you control the player on the WASD keys.<br />\r\nand aim with the mouse, when you aim at the object, shoot, if you hit the right point, the object will be destroyed, you need to destroy objects as quickly as possible.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nObjects have displaced centers of impact, so you need to understand exactly which point of the object to shoot at.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBreak objects the fastest! Be the first on the Steam leaderboard!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game has achievements.",
